      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I think you might have gotten a bit carried away with the analogies there. Can you just stick to the actual chemistry? I really need to focus on the specific chemical pathways, like the Amadori rearrangement, and how the alkalinity specifically influences the nucleophilic attack of the amino group.",
      "source": "evaluator"
